---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ghost of Tsushima — PS5 Director's Cut Buying Guide"
  description="Ghost of Tsushima Director's Cut buying guide: PS4 vs PS5, Iki Island DLC, and where to buy the digital version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Ghost of Tsushima — PS5 Director's Cut Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Ghost of Tsushima</strong> is Sucker Punch's samurai epic, and the
      <em>Director's Cut</em> on PS5 adds the Iki Island expansion and haptic-dualsense
      features that make it the definitive version.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Director's Cut</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Director's Cut (PS5)</strong> — includes Iki Island story content and all PS5 upgrades; this is the one to buy</li>
      <li><strong>PS4 version</strong> — can be upgraded to Director's Cut for a fee</li>
      <li><strong>Physical vs digital</strong> — digital keys on key stores often beat the PS Store</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      Green Man Gaming's PSN codes for the Director's Cut routinely undercut the
      PlayStation Store, and the game sees regular key-store cuts years after launch.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=ghost+of+tsushima+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Ghost+of+Tsushima+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
